# Cursor-only execution depth

**Development lifecycle and branches:** [WORKFLOW.md](../../WORKFLOW.md) is the shared map. Before the first implementation edit on a commissioned Change, create its dedicated `change/<id>-<slug>` branch from the packet's actual integration target; no per-T-ID branches. Parent squash-integrates to that same target after closure. See [mandatory branch policy](../../.agents/references/bounded-parent-orchestration.md#mandatory-change-branch-policy).

**PARENT FINITE-BATCH RULE (always):** [bounded orchestration](../../.agents/references/bounded-parent-orchestration.md). Before launching children, name a finite authorized batch (normally 2–5 T-IDs or one integration-heavy join), owners/resources and its exit proof. **Checkpoint at five dispatches or earlier on a boundary:** inspect combined diff, focused/negative tests, reconcile each touched Change, archive only truly achieved Goals, commit coherent owned files, report, then STOP **for a batch-only commission**. For an explicitly commissioned full Change, checkpoint and then **continue through remaining ready T-IDs within that same Change** until its Goal is accepted or genuinely blocked; do not request owner approval after every checkpoint. At most two checkpoints per parent turn applies to batch-only work, not the lifetime of an expressly commissioned Change. No automatic next-Change sweep; no repeated failure loop. Shared-checkout subagents must not stage/commit; isolated branch commits are optional. The parent alone integrates. Keep this rule more important than producing lengthy reports.

Parent MUST give every delegated task `DEPTH=VERIFY|PATCH|INVESTIGATE` plus a selected microtask T-ID when TASKS.md exists. **Default model is Composer Standard for parent and child.** **Depth is not risk or model effort.** A money-sensitive but fully specified, safely isolated test is `VERIFY` with Composer Standard; risk controls live in approved preconditions, not model price. Allowed model configurations remain in [Cursor cost policy](../../.agents/references/cursor-model-budget-policy.md).

- **VERIFY:** run the given command/procedure and record factual evidence. Read only the handoff, exact safety preconditions and necessary named runbook heading. Check git status; run the specified check once. No broad wiki/code discovery, speculative fixes, or unrelated tests. If blocked, make at most one error-directed diagnostic, record FAIL/NOT-RUN and stop. No silent promotion to PATCH.
- **PATCH:** implement ONE owner-selected, planner-resolved microtask (or one tiny Change when TASKS.md is unnecessary). Read the selected Change/route card, one relevant authority heading and 2–5 named source/test anchors. Then edit, run focused normal/negative proof, reconcile affected docs and required closure guards. Expand reading only for a concrete conflict, and say which uncertainty justified it.
- **INVESTIGATE:** only for an explicitly unresolved source/design question. Search narrowly, compare evidence and return the answer/owner or a proposed bounded Change. No unsolicited full-repo audit or speculative code edits.

**Stop searching** when owner, contract and negative case are known. Do not preload global skills, guard implementations or Markdown parsers. Run a guard first; inspect its implementation only if the error actually requires it. Prefer slices/symbols to large entire files. Do not spawn children to rediscover a parent's findings.

On a mismatch, report exact file/symbol, failed prerequisite and suggested narrow next action to ChatGPT planner via parent. No self-upgrade to Grok. Parent may issue a **new** scoped task; the child may not silently upgrade depth, model, speed or effort. Never High/Fast/Grok 4.7/Auto.

**Return:** DEPTH, command/edits, result/counts, actual checks, meaningful negative, blocker, source/commit and any justified extra reads. Unknown cost/tokens remain unknown.

**HK03 example:** 32-case Storyteller integration suite = `VERIFY`: check status and named disposable prerequisites, conditionally start the authorized local services, run the specified suite once, record pass/fail or NOT-RUN and commit the packet evidence. Don't start new engine/wiki research. Never reset protected DBs, delete volumes, run kind or call paid providers.
